  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.0 - Initial Release\n      - Auto-detect Test/Production environments from configuration\n      - Environment variable-based credential management\n      - Support for SELECT queries (DataTable/DataSet)\n      - Support for INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE commands\n      - Support for scalar queries with type casting\n      - Parameterized query support for SQL injection protection\n      - Connection pooling and reuse\n      - Custom StarburstException with query context\n      - SSL/TLS secure connections\n      - Full XML documentation for IntelliSense",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "summary": "Helper library for Starburst data warehouse queries with automatic Test/Production environment switching.",
